        "Content": "New to the Market – Charming 2/3 Bedroom Detached Country Cottage on Mature Site\r\nCreggameen, Trien, Castlerea, Co. Roscommon \r\n\r\nGuide Price: €185,000\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this quaint and beautifully maintained 2/3 bedroom detached country cottage, set on a spacious, mature site offering privacy, character and modern comfort.\r\n\r\nThis property combines traditional charm with significant recent upgrades, including a newly constructed roof, new oil-fired central heating system, pumped wall insulation and external wrap, making it both comfortable and energy efficient.\r\n\r\nSet in a quiet cul-de-sac in a peaceful rural setting, the property enjoys a south-facing rear garden, mature hedging and excellent outdoor space, ideal for those seeking a relaxed countryside lifestyle.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprises:\r\n\r\nDining Room:\r\nTimber-effect tiled flooring, 12kW wood burning stove, timber ceiling, fitted curtains and shelving.\r\n\r\nSitting Room:\r\nBright dual-aspect room with raised ceiling for extra light, timber-effect tiled flooring, multi-fuel stove with tiled surround and granite hearth, fitted curtains.\r\n\r\nKitchen:\r\nFitted units, Belfast sink, bottle gas cooker, tiled floor and timber ceiling.\r\n\r\nUtility:\r\nTiled flooring with PVC door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom:\r\nFully tiled floor and walls, WC, WHB and electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedrooms:\r\nBedroom 1: Double room with timber-effect tiled flooring, fitted wardrobe, curtains and dual-aspect windows\r\nAdditional adjoining room ideal as home office / third bedroom\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Timber-effect tiled flooring, timber ceiling, fitted curtains and views over rear garden\r\n\r\nOutside & Grounds:\r\nLarge mature site with hedging and shrubbery\r\nSouth-facing rear garden\r\nPolytunnel\r\nWorkshop\r\nLarge fuel shed\r\nRear access to garden and outbuildings\r\n\r\nFeatures Include:\r\nRecently upgraded with new roof and heating system\r\nExternally wrapped and pumped insulation for efficiency\r\nPVC double glazed windows and doors\r\nTwo solid fuel stoves adding warmth and character\r\nPrivate cul-de-sac location\r\nExcellent outdoor space with multiple uses\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nApprox. 8 minutes to Castlerea\r\nApprox. 6 minutes to Williamstown\r\nApprox. 5 minutes to Ballinlough\r\nApprox. 30 minutes to Knock Airport\r\n\r\nThis is a charming countryside home with real character and modern upgrades, offering an ideal opportunity for those seeking peace, space and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment.\r\nSole Agent: Nigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\r\n086 2130723 | 094 9362216\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all details."
      },
